# Git commits

When creating git commits in this repo:

- **Do not** add `Co-authored-by: Cursor` or `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>` (or any Cursor co-author trailer).
- **Do not** add `Made-with: Cursor` or similar Cursor attribution trailers.
- Set author on the commit (do **not** run `git config`):

```bash
git commit --author="saroj990 <saroj990@users.noreply.github.com>" -m "$(cat <<'EOF'
message

EOF
)"
```

- Commit message: why, 1–2 sentences, follow existing log style. No Cursor mentions.
